{"scenario_id":"saturday-swap","title":"The Saturday swap","category":"shift-trade","setting":"Coffee shop","summary":"One barista needs Saturday evening off. The other wants more hours, but not at any price.","story":["Maya is on the schedule to close this Saturday (8 hours) and has a family dinner that evening. Jordan opens on Sunday and has been asking for more hours.","The manager has said the two of them can sort it out between themselves, as long as every shift is covered and the answer is in by Thursday.","A straight handover costs Maya a day’s pay. A swap for Sunday or for Jordan’s Wednesday evening would win some of it back, at Jordan’s expense."],"recurring":false,"caution":null,"facts":[{"id":"nameA","label":"Name","group":"Needs Saturday off","kind":"text","value":"Maya"},{"id":"wageA","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Needs Saturday off","kind":"money","value":"16.5"},{"id":"otherA","label":"Other hours this week","group":"Needs Saturday off","kind":"number","value":"14"},{"id":"nameB","label":"Name","group":"Could cover","kind":"text","value":"Jordan"},{"id":"wageB","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Could cover","kind":"money","value":"17.25"},{"id":"otherB","label":"Other hours this week","group":"Could cover","kind":"number","value":"13"},{"id":"satHours","label":"Saturday close, hours","group":"Shifts","kind":"number","value":"8"},{"id":"sunHours","label":"Sunday open, hours","group":"Shifts","kind":"number","value":"6"},{"id":"wedHours","label":"Wednesday evening, hours","group":"Shifts","kind":"number","value":"5"}],"shifts":[{"id":"sat-early","label":"Saturday close, first half","hours":4},{"id":"sat-late","label":"Saturday close, second half","hours":4},{"id":"sun-open","label":"Sunday open","hours":6},{"id":"wed-eve","label":"Wednesday evening","hours":5}],"issues":[{"id":"sat","label":"Saturday close","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Maya works it"},{"id":"b","label":"Jordan covers all of it"},{"id":"split","label":"Split: Maya first half, Jordan second half"}],"status_quo":"a"},{"id":"sun","label":"Sunday open","options":[{"id":"b","label":"Jordan works it"},{"id":"a","label":"Maya takes it"}],"status_quo":"b"},{"id":"wed","label":"Wednesday evening","options":[{"id":"b","label":"Jordan works it"},{"id":"a","label":"Maya takes it"}],"status_quo":"b"}],"people":[{"id":"a","name":"Maya","role":"Barista, part-time","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Scheduled to close on Saturday. Has asked for the evening off for a family event.","private_brief":"Your sister’s graduation dinner is on Saturday evening, so the second half of the close is out. You can give up some hours this week, but rent is due and your pay can’t drop too far. School also caps how many extra hours you can pick up.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Pay this week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours this week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"weekendHours","label":"Weekend hours","unit":"hours","better":"lower"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Time off","weights":[{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-1},{"measure":"weeklyHours","weight":-0.5}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-0.6666666666666666},{"measure":"weeklyHours","weight":-0.3333333333333333}]}],"limits":[{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["sat-early","sat-late","sun-open","wed-eve"],"suggested_shifts":["sat-late"]},{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest pay I can accept this week","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":180,"max":585,"step":5,"suggested":290,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxHours","kind":"max","label":"Most hours I can work this week","measure":"weeklyHours","unit":"hours","min":0,"max":48,"step":1,"suggested":26,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"b","name":"Jordan","role":"Barista, part-time","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Opens on Sunday. Has been asking the manager for more hours.","private_brief":"You want more hours and you’re glad to help, but not for free. You won’t end the week with noticeably less pay than you have now, and much more than 30 hours collides with your other commitments.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Pay this week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours this week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"weekendHours","label":"Weekend hours","unit":"hours","better":"lower"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Time off","weights":[{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-1},{"measure":"weeklyHours","weight":-0.5}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-0.6666666666666666},{"measure":"weeklyHours","weight":-0.3333333333333333}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest pay I can accept this week","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":205,"max":665,"step":5,"suggested":395,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxHours","kind":"max","label":"Most hours I can work this week","measure":"weeklyHours","unit":"hours","min":0,"max":48,"step":1,"suggested":30,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["sat-early","sat-late","sun-open","wed-eve"],"suggested_shifts":[]}]}],"arrangement_count":11}
{"scenario_id":"holiday-weekend","title":"Holiday weekend cover","category":"shift-trade","setting":"Retail store","summary":"Three shifts on the busiest weekend of the year. One person was handed two, one got none.","story":["The draft schedule for the holiday weekend is up. Dev has Saturday open and Sunday, Priya has Saturday close, and Sam has the whole weekend off.","Each shift is 8 hours and pays a $2.00 holiday premium on top of the usual rate. Store policy rules out anyone working both Saturday shifts back to back.","The manager will post whatever the three of them agree on, provided all three shifts are covered."],"recurring":false,"caution":null,"facts":[{"id":"nameA","label":"Name","group":"Drafted for Saturday close","kind":"text","value":"Priya"},{"id":"wageA","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Drafted for Saturday close","kind":"money","value":"17"},{"id":"otherA","label":"Other hours this week","group":"Drafted for Saturday close","kind":"number","value":"20"},{"id":"nameB","label":"Name","group":"Drafted for two shifts","kind":"text","value":"Dev"},{"id":"wageB","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Drafted for two shifts","kind":"money","value":"16.25"},{"id":"otherB","label":"Other hours this week","group":"Drafted for two shifts","kind":"number","value":"16"},{"id":"nameC","label":"Name","group":"Has the weekend off","kind":"text","value":"Sam"},{"id":"wageC","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Has the weekend off","kind":"money","value":"18.5"},{"id":"otherC","label":"Other hours this week","group":"Has the weekend off","kind":"number","value":"24"},{"id":"shiftHours","label":"Length of each weekend shift, hours","group":"Shifts","kind":"number","value":"8"},{"id":"premium","label":"Holiday premium per hour","group":"Shifts","kind":"money","value":"2"}],"shifts":[{"id":"sat-open","label":"Saturday open","hours":8},{"id":"sat-close","label":"Saturday close","hours":8},{"id":"sun-mid","label":"Sunday mid-shift","hours":8}],"issues":[{"id":"sat-open","label":"Saturday open","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Priya"},{"id":"b","label":"Dev"},{"id":"c","label":"Sam"}],"status_quo":"b"},{"id":"sat-close","label":"Saturday close","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Priya"},{"id":"b","label":"Dev"},{"id":"c","label":"Sam"}],"status_quo":"a"},{"id":"sun-mid","label":"Sunday mid-shift","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Priya"},{"id":"b","label":"Dev"},{"id":"c","label":"Sam"}],"status_quo":"b"}],"people":[{"id":"a","name":"Priya","role":"Sales associate","kind":"worker","public_brief":"On the draft for Saturday close. Says Saturday night is a problem.","private_brief":"You look after your nephew on Saturday nights, so the close is out. You’d happily take a daytime shift instead, even two, because the holiday premium helps. Much past 36 hours and you’re too worn out for Monday.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Pay this week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours this week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"weekendHours","label":"Holiday weekend hours","unit":"hours","better":"lower"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Time off this weekend","weights":[{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["sat-open","sat-close","sun-mid"],"suggested_shifts":["sat-close"]},{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest pay I can accept this week","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":245,"max":790,"step":5,"suggested":475,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxHours","kind":"max","label":"Most hours I can work this week","measure":"weeklyHours","unit":"hours","min":0,"max":48,"step":1,"suggested":36,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"b","name":"Dev","role":"Sales associate","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Drafted for two of the three holiday shifts. Says that is one too many.","private_brief":"You’ve been handed both Saturday open and Sunday, again. One holiday shift is fair; two is not. You can live with the smaller paycheck that comes with working one.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Pay this week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours this week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"weekendHours","label":"Holiday weekend hours","unit":"hours","better":"lower"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Time off this weekend","weights":[{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"maxWeekend","kind":"max","label":"Most holiday weekend hours I can work","measure":"weekendHours","unit":"hours","min":0,"max":24,"step":1,"suggested":8,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest pay I can accept this week","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":275,"max":885,"step":5,"suggested":395,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["sat-open","sat-close","sun-mid"],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"c","name":"Sam","role":"Senior sales associate","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Has the weekend off on the draft. Worked the last three holiday weekends.","private_brief":"You were promised this weekend off after covering the last three. You’ll come in for one shift to keep the peace, but not the Saturday close, and not two.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Pay this week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours this week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"weekendHours","label":"Holiday weekend hours","unit":"hours","better":"lower"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Time off this weekend","weights":[{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"weekendHours","weight":-1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["sat-open","sat-close","sun-mid"],"suggested_shifts":["sat-close"]},{"id":"maxWeekend","kind":"max","label":"Most holiday weekend hours I can work","measure":"weekendHours","unit":"hours","min":0,"max":24,"step":1,"suggested":8,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest pay I can accept this week","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":220,"max":715,"step":5,"suggested":440,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]}],"arrangement_count":17}
{"scenario_id":"last-bus","title":"The last bus home","category":"shift-trade","setting":"Grocery store","summary":"Three weekend closes carry a night differential. One clerk needs out of them, the other can only take so many.","story":["Alex has closed the store on Friday, Saturday and Sunday for over a year. A bus route change means the last bus now leaves before the close ends.","Rosa opens on Saturday and Sunday and works a Thursday mid-shift. Closes pay a night differential: $1.50 an hour on Friday and Saturday, $2.50 on Sunday.","On Saturday and Sunday the two of them cover open and close between them, so giving up a close means taking the open. Friday close and the Thursday mid-shift can each go to either person."],"recurring":true,"caution":null,"facts":[{"id":"nameA","label":"Name","group":"Closes now","kind":"text","value":"Alex"},{"id":"wageA","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Closes now","kind":"money","value":"17.8"},{"id":"otherA","label":"Other weekly hours","group":"Closes now","kind":"number","value":"8"},{"id":"nameB","label":"Name","group":"Opens now","kind":"text","value":"Rosa"},{"id":"wageB","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Opens now","kind":"money","value":"16.9"},{"id":"otherB","label":"Other weekly hours","group":"Opens now","kind":"number","value":"8"},{"id":"shiftHours","label":"Length of each shift, hours","group":"Shifts","kind":"number","value":"8"},{"id":"nightDiff","label":"Friday and Saturday close differential per hour","group":"Shifts","kind":"money","value":"1.5"},{"id":"sunDiff","label":"Sunday close differential per hour","group":"Shifts","kind":"money","value":"2.5"}],"shifts":[{"id":"thu-mid","label":"Thursday mid-shift","hours":8},{"id":"fri-close","label":"Friday close","hours":8},{"id":"sat-open","label":"Saturday open","hours":8},{"id":"sat-close","label":"Saturday close","hours":8},{"id":"sun-open","label":"Sunday open","hours":8},{"id":"sun-close","label":"Sunday close","hours":8}],"issues":[{"id":"fri","label":"Friday close","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Alex closes"},{"id":"b","label":"Rosa closes"}],"status_quo":"a"},{"id":"sat","label":"Saturday","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Alex closes, Rosa opens"},{"id":"b","label":"Rosa closes, Alex opens"}],"status_quo":"a"},{"id":"sun","label":"Sunday","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Alex closes, Rosa opens"},{"id":"b","label":"Rosa closes, Alex opens"}],"status_quo":"a"},{"id":"thu","label":"Thursday mid-shift","options":[{"id":"b","label":"Rosa works it"},{"id":"a","label":"Alex takes it"}],"status_quo":"b"}],"people":[{"id":"a","name":"Alex","role":"Grocery clerk","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Closes Friday, Saturday and Sunday. Since the route change, the last bus leaves before closing time.","private_brief":"You’ve been paying for a ride home three nights a week. You want out of the late closes, though one a week is manageable. The night differential is real money, so your pay can’t fall too far.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"lateCloses","label":"Late closes a week","unit":"count","better":"lower"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Fewer late nights","weights":[{"measure":"lateCloses","weight":-1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"lateCloses","weight":-1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"maxCloses","kind":"max","label":"Most late closes I can do in a week","measure":"lateCloses","unit":"count","min":0,"max":3,"step":1,"suggested":1,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":305,"max":985,"step":5,"suggested":565,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["thu-mid","fri-close","sat-open","sat-close","sun-open","sun-close"],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"b","name":"Rosa","role":"Grocery clerk","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Opens Saturday and Sunday. Has said the night differential would be welcome.","private_brief":"The differential would help, and you can take on late closes, but two a week is your ceiling: your partner works nights and childcare runs out. You won’t take a pay cut to do a favor, and 36 hours is the most you can manage.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"lateCloses","label":"Late closes a week","unit":"count","better":"lower"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Fewer late nights","weights":[{"measure":"lateCloses","weight":-1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"lateCloses","weight":-1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"maxCloses","kind":"max","label":"Most late closes I can do in a week","measure":"lateCloses","unit":"count","min":0,"max":3,"step":1,"suggested":2,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":270,"max":870,"step":5,"suggested":540,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxHours","kind":"max","label":"Most hours I can work in a week","measure":"weeklyHours","unit":"hours","min":0,"max":48,"step":1,"suggested":36,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["thu-mid","fri-close","sat-open","sat-close","sun-open","sun-close"],"suggested_shifts":[]}]}],"arrangement_count":15}
{"scenario_id":"kitchen-share","title":"A share for the kitchen","category":"tip-split","setting":"Restaurant","summary":"The line cook wants into the tip pool. Every point that goes to the kitchen comes out of someone else’s week.","story":["On the shifts these three work together, the tip pool comes to about $900.00 a week. Today Tasha gets 10% for hosting and bussing, Lena keeps the rest, and the kitchen gets nothing.","Marcus has asked the owner to cut the kitchen in. The owner’s answer: agree on a split among yourselves and it will go on the next schedule.","Hours and hourly wages stay as they are. Only the split of the pool is on the table."],"recurring":true,"caution":"Tip-pooling rules differ by state and country, including who is allowed to share in a pool. Check the rules where you work before changing a real one.","facts":[{"id":"nameA","label":"Name","group":"Server","kind":"text","value":"Lena"},{"id":"wageA","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Server","kind":"money","value":"16"},{"id":"hoursA","label":"Weekly hours","group":"Server","kind":"number","value":"28"},{"id":"nameB","label":"Name","group":"Line cook","kind":"text","value":"Marcus"},{"id":"wageB","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Line cook","kind":"money","value":"19.5"},{"id":"hoursB","label":"Weekly hours","group":"Line cook","kind":"number","value":"38"},{"id":"nameC","label":"Name","group":"Host and busser","kind":"text","value":"Tasha"},{"id":"wageC","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Host and busser","kind":"money","value":"16"},{"id":"hoursC","label":"Weekly hours","group":"Host and busser","kind":"number","value":"24"},{"id":"pool","label":"Tips in the pool each week","group":"Tip pool","kind":"money","value":"900"}],"shifts":[],"issues":[{"id":"kitchen","label":"Kitchen share of the pool","options":[{"id":"0","label":"None"},{"id":"10","label":"10%"},{"id":"15","label":"15%"},{"id":"20","label":"20%"},{"id":"25","label":"25%"}],"status_quo":"0"},{"id":"floor","label":"Host and busser share of the pool","options":[{"id":"10","label":"10%"},{"id":"15","label":"15%"},{"id":"20","label":"20%"}],"status_quo":"10"}],"people":[{"id":"a","name":"Lena","role":"Server","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Keeps 90% of the pool today. Says tips are payment for table service.","private_brief":"Your hourly wage is the lowest in the building and tips are most of your income. You accept that the kitchen deserves something, but if your share drops below about 70% of the pool you can’t cover your bills.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyTips","label":"Tips a week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":625,"max":2015,"step":5,"suggested":1075,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minRate","kind":"min","label":"Lowest effective hourly I can accept","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":31.25,"max":67.25,"step":0.25,"suggested":null,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"b","name":"Marcus","role":"Line cook","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Gets no share of tips today. Says the food is what guests are tipping for.","private_brief":"You work the longest hours and see none of the tips. You’re not asking for half, but anything under 10% of the pool would feel like a brush-off.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyTips","label":"Tips a week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":435,"max":1405,"step":5,"suggested":830,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minRate","kind":"min","label":"Lowest effective hourly I can accept","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":13.5,"max":29.25,"step":0.25,"suggested":null,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"c","name":"Tasha","role":"Host and busser","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Gets 10% of the pool today. Seats and clears every table and thinks that share is low.","private_brief":"You seat, clear and reset every table. You want at least 15% of the pool, and you won’t accept a deal that pays for the kitchen’s share out of yours.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyTips","label":"Tips a week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":255,"max":835,"step":5,"suggested":515,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minRate","kind":"min","label":"Lowest effective hourly I can accept","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":11,"max":24,"step":0.25,"suggested":null,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]}],"arrangement_count":14}
{"scenario_id":"tip-jar","title":"The tip jar","category":"tip-split","setting":"Café counter","summary":"Equal thirds, or by the hour? The full-timer, the part-timer and the weekend regular each have a different answer.","story":["The counter jar brings in about $540.00 a week and has always been split in equal thirds. About 50% of it comes in on Saturday and Sunday.","Nia works 36 hours a week, Owen works 20, and Bea works 12, all of them on the weekend.","The owner will pay out the jar however the three of them agree to split it."],"recurring":true,"caution":"Tip-pooling rules differ by state and country. Check the rules where you work before changing a real split.","facts":[{"id":"nameA","label":"Name","group":"Full-timer","kind":"text","value":"Nia"},{"id":"wageA","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Full-timer","kind":"money","value":"17.5"},{"id":"weekdayA","label":"Weekday hours","group":"Full-timer","kind":"number","value":"28"},{"id":"weekendA","label":"Weekend hours","group":"Full-timer","kind":"number","value":"8"},{"id":"nameB","label":"Name","group":"Part-timer","kind":"text","value":"Owen"},{"id":"wageB","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Part-timer","kind":"money","value":"16"},{"id":"weekdayB","label":"Weekday hours","group":"Part-timer","kind":"number","value":"16"},{"id":"weekendB","label":"Weekend hours","group":"Part-timer","kind":"number","value":"4"},{"id":"nameC","label":"Name","group":"Weekends only","kind":"text","value":"Bea"},{"id":"wageC","label":"Hourly wage","group":"Weekends only","kind":"money","value":"16"},{"id":"weekdayC","label":"Weekday hours","group":"Weekends only","kind":"number","value":"0"},{"id":"weekendC","label":"Weekend hours","group":"Weekends only","kind":"number","value":"12"},{"id":"jar","label":"Tips in the jar each week","group":"Tip jar","kind":"money","value":"540"},{"id":"weekendShare","label":"Percent of the jar that comes in on the weekend","group":"Tip jar","kind":"number","value":"50"}],"shifts":[],"issues":[{"id":"method","label":"How the jar is split","options":[{"id":"equal","label":"Equal thirds"},{"id":"hours","label":"By hours worked"},{"id":"days","label":"Tips stay with the days they came in"},{"id":"blend","label":"Half in equal thirds, half by hours"}],"status_quo":"equal"},{"id":"weight","label":"A weekend hour counts as","options":[{"id":"1","label":"One hour, same as a weekday"},{"id":"1.25","label":"1.25 hours"},{"id":"1.5","label":"1.5 hours"}],"status_quo":"1"}],"people":[{"id":"a","name":"Nia","role":"Barista, full-time","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Works the most hours by far. Says an equal split shortchanges the people who are there all week.","private_brief":"You work 36 hours and take home the same tips as someone who works 12. You want the split to follow hours. You’d accept a compromise, but only if your tips come to about $225.00 a week or more.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyTips","label":"Tips a week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":405,"max":1300,"step":5,"suggested":855,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minRate","kind":"min","label":"Lowest effective hourly I can accept","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":12.25,"max":26.25,"step":0.25,"suggested":null,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"b","name":"Owen","role":"Barista, part-time","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Happy with the equal split. Worried that a change will cut into their tips.","private_brief":"The equal split works well for you. You expect to lose a little if it changes, and you can absorb that, but not a big cut.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyTips","label":"Tips a week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":250,"max":805,"step":5,"suggested":460,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minRate","kind":"min","label":"Lowest effective hourly I can accept","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":11,"max":24,"step":0.25,"suggested":null,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"c","name":"Bea","role":"Barista, weekends only","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Works only Saturday and Sunday, the busiest days. Says weekend shifts fill most of the jar.","private_brief":"Your two shifts are the busiest of the week. A plain by-hours split would cut your tips nearly in half, and at that point the job stops being worth the bus fare.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyTips","label":"Tips a week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":185,"max":600,"step":5,"suggested":310,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minRate","kind":"min","label":"Lowest effective hourly I can accept","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":11,"max":24,"step":0.25,"suggested":null,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]}],"arrangement_count":7}
{"scenario_id":"friday-dinner","title":"Friday dinner","category":"tip-split","setting":"Restaurant","summary":"The senior server holds both weekend dinners. The newer one works the slow lunches and wants a share of the good nights.","story":["Gloria has held the Friday and Saturday dinner shifts for years. Theo works Tuesday and Wednesday lunch, where the tips are far smaller.","The manager is willing to change who works which shift, rotate them, or keep the schedule and have dinner tips partly shared with whoever worked the matching lunch.","Whoever gives up a dinner takes the matching lunch, so both servers keep four shifts between these days."],"recurring":true,"caution":"Tip-sharing rules differ by state and country. Check the rules where you work before changing a real arrangement.","facts":[{"id":"nameA","label":"Name","group":"Senior server","kind":"text","value":"Gloria"},{"id":"otherHoursA","label":"Other weekly hours","group":"Senior server","kind":"number","value":"16"},{"id":"otherTipsA","label":"Tips from other shifts","group":"Senior server","kind":"money","value":"330"},{"id":"nameB","label":"Name","group":"Newer server","kind":"text","value":"Theo"},{"id":"otherHoursB","label":"Other weekly hours","group":"Newer server","kind":"number","value":"14"},{"id":"otherTipsB","label":"Tips from other shifts","group":"Newer server","kind":"money","value":"180"},{"id":"wage","label":"Server hourly wage","group":"Shifts","kind":"money","value":"16"},{"id":"dinnerHours","label":"Dinner shift, hours","group":"Shifts","kind":"number","value":"6"},{"id":"lunchHours","label":"Lunch shift, hours","group":"Shifts","kind":"number","value":"5"},{"id":"friTips","label":"Friday dinner tips","group":"Shifts","kind":"money","value":"210"},{"id":"satTips","label":"Saturday dinner tips","group":"Shifts","kind":"money","value":"240"},{"id":"tueTips","label":"Tuesday lunch tips","group":"Shifts","kind":"money","value":"70"},{"id":"wedTips","label":"Wednesday lunch tips","group":"Shifts","kind":"money","value":"75"}],"shifts":[{"id":"fri-dinner","label":"Friday dinner","hours":6},{"id":"sat-dinner","label":"Saturday dinner","hours":6},{"id":"tue-lunch","label":"Tuesday lunch","hours":5},{"id":"wed-lunch","label":"Wednesday lunch","hours":5}],"issues":[{"id":"fri","label":"Friday dinner","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Gloria works it, Theo takes Tuesday lunch"},{"id":"b","label":"Theo works it, Gloria takes Tuesday lunch"},{"id":"alt","label":"Alternate weeks, swapping with Tuesday lunch"}],"status_quo":"a"},{"id":"sat","label":"Saturday dinner","options":[{"id":"a","label":"Gloria works it, Theo takes Wednesday lunch"},{"id":"b","label":"Theo works it, Gloria takes Wednesday lunch"},{"id":"alt","label":"Alternate weeks, swapping with Wednesday lunch"}],"status_quo":"a"},{"id":"share","label":"Dinner tips passed to the server on the matching lunch","options":[{"id":"0","label":"None"},{"id":"10","label":"10%"},{"id":"20","label":"20%"}],"status_quo":"0"}],"people":[{"id":"a","name":"Gloria","role":"Server, six years","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Has worked Friday and Saturday dinner for years. Says those shifts were earned.","private_brief":"The weekend dinners are most of your income and you built up those regulars yourself. You’d give some ground to keep the peace, but you can’t lose more than about a tenth of your pay. Wednesday lunch is impossible: that’s your day with your grandson.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Average weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyTips","label":"Tips a week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"primeDinners","label":"Weekend dinners a week","unit":"count","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Working the weekend dinners","weights":[{"measure":"primeDinners","weight":1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"primeDinners","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":610,"max":1965,"step":5,"suggested":1095,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["fri-dinner","sat-dinner","tue-lunch","wed-lunch"],"suggested_shifts":["wed-lunch"]}]},{"id":"b","name":"Theo","role":"Server, eight months","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Works the Tuesday and Wednesday lunches. Wants a fair shot at the nights where the tips are.","private_brief":"You take home far less than the senior server for nearly the same hours. You need roughly 10% more to make this job work, whether that comes from working dinners or from a share of them.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Average weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyTips","label":"Tips a week","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"primeDinners","label":"Weekend dinners a week","unit":"count","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours a week","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Effective hourly","unit":"rate","better":"higher"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Working the weekend dinners","weights":[{"measure":"primeDinners","weight":1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"primeDinners","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":350,"max":1135,"step":5,"suggested":775,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"unavailable","kind":"unavailable","label":"Shifts I can’t work","measure":null,"unit":null,"min":null,"max":null,"step":null,"suggested":null,"shift_options":["fri-dinner","sat-dinner","tue-lunch","wed-lunch"],"suggested_shifts":[]}]}],"arrangement_count":26}
{"scenario_id":"keyholder-raise","title":"Keys without the pay","category":"wage","setting":"Hardware store","summary":"Three months of opening and closing the store at an associate’s rate. Time to ask for the pay that goes with the keys.","story":["When the store’s keyholder quit three months ago, Dana started opening and closing, counting the till and setting the alarm. The pay stayed at $16.75/hr, the associate rate.","Dana has asked Ravi, the store manager, for a raise that reflects the job. Ravi wants to keep Dana and needs the closes covered, but answers to a district labor budget.","Three things can move: the hourly rate, the number of guaranteed hours, and how many closes come with the role."],"recurring":true,"caution":null,"facts":[{"id":"nameA","label":"Name","group":"Associate","kind":"text","value":"Dana"},{"id":"rate","label":"Current hourly rate","group":"Associate","kind":"money","value":"16.75"},{"id":"hours","label":"Guaranteed weekly hours","group":"Associate","kind":"number","value":"24"},{"id":"closes","label":"Keyholder closes a week","group":"Associate","kind":"number","value":"3"},{"id":"nameM","label":"Name","group":"Manager","kind":"text","value":"Ravi"}],"shifts":[],"issues":[{"id":"rate","label":"Hourly rate","options":[{"id":"0","label":"$16.75/hr, no change"},{"id":"0.75","label":"$17.50/hr, a $0.75 raise"},{"id":"1.25","label":"$18.00/hr, a $1.25 raise"},{"id":"1.75","label":"$18.50/hr, a $1.75 raise"},{"id":"2.25","label":"$19.00/hr, a $2.25 raise"}],"status_quo":"0"},{"id":"hours","label":"Guaranteed weekly hours","options":[{"id":"24","label":"24 hours"},{"id":"28","label":"28 hours"},{"id":"32","label":"32 hours"}],"status_quo":"24"},{"id":"closes","label":"Keyholder closes a week","options":[{"id":"2","label":"2 closes"},{"id":"3","label":"3 closes"},{"id":"4","label":"4 closes"}],"status_quo":"3"}],"people":[{"id":"a","name":"Dana","role":"Sales associate, acting keyholder","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Has opened and closed the store with the keys for three months at an associate’s rate. Wants the pay to match the job.","private_brief":"You’ve carried keyholder duties since the last keyholder quit, with no change in pay. A shop down the road pays keyholders $18.00/hr. You want at least that, you’d welcome more guaranteed hours, and 3 closes a week is already your limit.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Hourly rate","unit":"rate","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours guaranteed","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"lateCloses","label":"Keyholder closes a week","unit":"count","better":"lower"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"rate","label":"A higher hourly rate","weights":[{"measure":"hourlyRate","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Fewer late closes","weights":[{"measure":"lateCloses","weight":-1}]},{"id":"both","label":"All about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"hourlyRate","weight":1},{"measure":"lateCloses","weight":-1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minRate","kind":"min","label":"Lowest hourly rate I can accept","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":16.75,"max":19.75,"step":0.25,"suggested":18,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":200,"max":645,"step":5,"suggested":430,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxHours","kind":"max","label":"Most hours I can work in a week","measure":"weeklyHours","unit":"hours","min":0,"max":48,"step":1,"suggested":32,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxCloses","kind":"max","label":"Most closes I can do in a week","measure":"lateCloses","unit":"count","min":0,"max":5,"step":1,"suggested":3,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"m","name":"Ravi","role":"Store manager","kind":"manager","public_brief":"Needs the closes covered and wants to keep a reliable keyholder. Has a labor budget and a pay band to work within.","private_brief":"You can’t afford to lose your keyholder, and you need at least 3 closes a week covered. But district sets the pay band for this role and your weekly labor budget has little slack. A bigger raise or more hours is possible. Probably not both.","measures":[{"key":"laborCost","label":"Weekly cost of the role","unit":"money","better":"lower"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Hourly rate paid","unit":"rate","better":"lower"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours guaranteed","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"closesCovered","label":"Closes covered a week","unit":"count","better":"higher"}],"priorities":[{"id":"cost","label":"Keeping costs down","weights":[{"measure":"laborCost","weight":-1}]},{"id":"cover","label":"Getting closes covered","weights":[{"measure":"closesCovered","weight":1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"laborCost","weight":-1},{"measure":"closesCovered","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"maxCost","kind":"max","label":"Most I can spend on this role in a week","measure":"laborCost","unit":"money","min":320,"max":610,"step":5,"suggested":540,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxRate","kind":"max","label":"Highest hourly rate the pay band allows","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":16.75,"max":19.75,"step":0.25,"suggested":18.5,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minCloses","kind":"min","label":"Fewest closes I need covered in a week","measure":"closesCovered","unit":"count","min":0,"max":5,"step":1,"suggested":3,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]}],"arrangement_count":44}
{"scenario_id":"outside-offer","title":"The outside offer","category":"wage","setting":"Garden center","summary":"A shift lead has a better offer in writing. The manager can’t match the rate, but hours and weekends are negotiable.","story":["Imani leads shifts at $18.40/hr, 30 hours a week, and works every weekend. A competitor has offered $20.50/hr for 32 hours.","Imani told Carla, the store manager, before answering. Carla wants to keep Imani but works within a pay band and a labor budget set above store level.","Three things can move: the hourly rate, the number of guaranteed hours, and how many weekend shifts a month come with the job."],"recurring":true,"caution":null,"facts":[{"id":"nameA","label":"Name","group":"Shift lead","kind":"text","value":"Imani"},{"id":"rate","label":"Current hourly rate","group":"Shift lead","kind":"money","value":"18.4"},{"id":"hours","label":"Guaranteed weekly hours","group":"Shift lead","kind":"number","value":"30"},{"id":"offerRate","label":"Outside offer, hourly rate","group":"Shift lead","kind":"money","value":"20.5"},{"id":"offerHours","label":"Outside offer, weekly hours","group":"Shift lead","kind":"number","value":"32"},{"id":"nameM","label":"Name","group":"Manager","kind":"text","value":"Carla"}],"shifts":[],"issues":[{"id":"rate","label":"Hourly rate","options":[{"id":"0","label":"$18.40/hr, no change"},{"id":"0.6","label":"$19.00/hr, a $0.60 raise"},{"id":"1.1","label":"$19.50/hr, a $1.10 raise"},{"id":"1.6","label":"$20.00/hr, a $1.60 raise"}],"status_quo":"0"},{"id":"hours","label":"Guaranteed weekly hours","options":[{"id":"30","label":"30 hours"},{"id":"34","label":"34 hours"},{"id":"38","label":"38 hours"}],"status_quo":"30"},{"id":"weekends","label":"Weekend shifts a month","options":[{"id":"4","label":"Every weekend"},{"id":"3","label":"Three a month"},{"id":"2","label":"Two a month"}],"status_quo":"4"}],"people":[{"id":"a","name":"Imani","role":"Shift lead","kind":"worker","public_brief":"Has a written offer from another employer. Would rather stay if the terms come close.","private_brief":"The other offer is $20.50/hr for 32 guaranteed hours. You like this team and would stay for a little less than that, but not for what you make now, and you’re done working every single weekend.","measures":[{"key":"weeklyPay","label":"Weekly pay","unit":"money","better":"higher"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Hourly rate","unit":"rate","better":"higher"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours guaranteed","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"weekendShifts","label":"Weekend shifts a month","unit":"count","better":"lower"}],"priorities":[{"id":"pay","label":"Take-home pay","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1}]},{"id":"rate","label":"A higher hourly rate","weights":[{"measure":"hourlyRate","weight":1}]},{"id":"other","label":"Weekends off","weights":[{"measure":"weekendShifts","weight":-1}]},{"id":"both","label":"All about equally","weights":[{"measure":"weeklyPay","weight":1},{"measure":"hourlyRate","weight":1},{"measure":"weekendShifts","weight":-1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"minPay","kind":"min","label":"Lowest weekly pay I can accept","measure":"weeklyPay","unit":"money","min":275,"max":885,"step":5,"suggested":620,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minRate","kind":"min","label":"Lowest hourly rate I can accept","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":18.25,"max":21.25,"step":0.05,"suggested":19,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxWeekends","kind":"max","label":"Most weekend shifts I’ll work in a month","measure":"weekendShifts","unit":"count","min":0,"max":4,"step":1,"suggested":3,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxHours","kind":"max","label":"Most hours I can work in a week","measure":"weeklyHours","unit":"hours","min":0,"max":48,"step":1,"suggested":38,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]},{"id":"m","name":"Carla","role":"Store manager","kind":"manager","public_brief":"Wants to keep an experienced shift lead. Can’t simply match the outside rate.","private_brief":"Replacing a shift lead would cost you months of training. The pay band tops out below the outside offer, so the difference has to come from hours or weekends. You still need most weekends covered.","measures":[{"key":"laborCost","label":"Weekly cost of the role","unit":"money","better":"lower"},{"key":"hourlyRate","label":"Hourly rate paid","unit":"rate","better":"lower"},{"key":"weeklyHours","label":"Hours guaranteed","unit":"hours","better":"neutral"},{"key":"weekendCover","label":"Weekend shifts covered a month","unit":"count","better":"higher"}],"priorities":[{"id":"cost","label":"Keeping costs down","weights":[{"measure":"laborCost","weight":-1}]},{"id":"cover","label":"Weekend coverage","weights":[{"measure":"weekendCover","weight":1}]},{"id":"both","label":"Both about equally","weights":[{"measure":"laborCost","weight":-1},{"measure":"weekendCover","weight":1}]}],"limits":[{"id":"maxCost","kind":"max","label":"Most I can spend on this role in a week","measure":"laborCost","unit":"money","min":440,"max":765,"step":5,"suggested":725,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"maxRate","kind":"max","label":"Highest hourly rate the pay band allows","measure":"hourlyRate","unit":"rate","min":18.25,"max":21.25,"step":0.05,"suggested":19.5,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]},{"id":"minWeekends","kind":"min","label":"Fewest weekend shifts I need covered in a month","measure":"weekendCover","unit":"count","min":0,"max":4,"step":1,"suggested":3,"shift_options":[],"suggested_shifts":[]}]}],"arrangement_count":35}
